<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
                    xmlns:controls="clr-namespace:BuildOrchestrator.App.Controls">
  <!--
    ============================ [T60] DS KONTROL KÜTÜPHANESİ ============================

    Uygulamanın TEK kontrol görünüm kaynağı. Buraya kadar uygulamada TEK BİR implicit style yoktu; stil
    verilmemiş Button/TextBox/ListBox WPF'in AÇIK-TEMA chrome'uyla çiziliyordu. Anahtar adları C/D/E
    fazlarının TÜKETTİĞİ bir SÖZLEŞMEDİR — yeniden adlandırmak pahalıdır.

    Değerler design-v1'den BİREBİR; her stilin başında kaynak satır numarası vardır
    (prototype/_ds/**/_ds_bundle.js ve prototype/app/BuildApp.jsx). Ham renk/ölçü literali YAZILMAZ:
    renk/boşluk/yarıçap Tokens.xaml'den, süre/eğri Motion.xaml'den, ikon + boyası Icons.xaml'den gelir.
    (İSTİSNA: bileşenin KENDİ ölçüleri — `height: 24`, `padding: '0 12px'` gibi kaynakta da token OLMAYAN
    sayılar — kaynak satırıyla birlikte doğrudan yazılır; bunlar token değil bileşen değerleridir.)

    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    STEP 1 KARARI — 120ms geçişler KOD TARAFINDA yazılır (saf-XAML Storyboard DEĞİL)
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Soru: bir Storyboard'un animasyonuna `{DynamicResource Duration.Fast}` bağlanabilir mi ve reduced-motion'ın
    canlı sıfırlamasını görür mü?

    ÖLÇÜM (MotionResourcesTests, iki test — ikisi de GEÇİYOR):
      (a) BAŞIBOŞ bir Storyboard (bir FrameworkElement'in Resources'ında duran) için EVET: DynamicResource
          çözülür ve sözlükteki canlı değişimi izler.
          `A_xaml_storyboard_duration_bound_with_DynamicResource_follows_a_live_dictionary_change`
      (b) Ama ASIL İHTİYAÇ DUYULAN biçim — `ControlTemplate.Triggers` içindeki bir Storyboard — İMKÂNSIZ:
          şablon mühürlenirken (FrameworkTemplate.Seal → EventTrigger.Seal → BeginStoryboard.Seal) zaman
          çizelgesi ağacı DONDURULMAK ZORUNDADIR ve DynamicResource taşıyan bir Freezable dondurulamaz.
          Sonuç, XAML YÜKLEME ANINDA bir XamlParseException'dır: "Bu Storyboard zaman çizelgesi ağacı iş
          parçacıkları arasında kullanılmak üzere dondurulamıyor."
          `A_control_template_trigger_storyboard_cannot_carry_a_DynamicResource_duration`
      `{StaticResource Duration.Fast}` dondurulabilir ama BİR KEZ çözülür — reduced-motion'ın canlı
      sıfırlamasını hiç görmez, yani motion sözleşmesini ihlal ederdi.

    KARAR: tüm 120ms durum geçişleri It-4a'nın KANITLI yolundan gider — trigger yalnız HEDEF FIRÇAYI ilan
    eder (`controls:DsTransition.Animated*`), geçişi kod sürer: `MotionTokens.TransitionColor` →
    `BeginAnimation(..., HandoffBehavior.SnapshotAndReplace)`; süre/eğri ve `AnimationsEnabled` BAŞLATMA
    ANINDA taze okunur (referans implementasyon: Controls/LatestPill.xaml.cs).
    Bu yüzden aşağıdaki şablonlarda TEK BİR Storyboard yoktur.

    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    A13.2 — ANİMASYON HEDEFİ ASLA PAYLAŞILAN TOKEN FIRÇASI DEĞİLDİR
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    Tokens.xaml'deki fırçalar paylaşılır ve donmuştur. `DsTransition` her öğeye KENDİ (donmamış) kopyasını
    kurar ve rengi O kopyada akıtır. Bu yüzden `Background`/`Foreground`/`BorderBrush` için doğrudan Setter
    KULLANILMAZ — tek yetkili `DsTransition.Animated*`'tır.

    NOT (gölgeler — B2 review carried-forward #2): `Effect.OverlayShadow` / `Effect.PopoverShadow` de
    PAYLAŞILAN ve DONMUŞ nesnelerdir. Paylaşmak doğrudur; ama gölgenin `Opacity`/`BlurRadius`'unu ANIMATE
    etmek isteyen bir tüketici fırçalarla AYNI duvara çarpar ve aynı çözümü uygulamalıdır: kendi (donmamış)
    kopyasını kurup onu sürmek. Popover/Dialog gölgeyi statik kullanır.

    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
    KAYNAK BİÇİMİ: bu sözlük headless testlerde TEK BAŞINA (XamlReader ile) yüklenir. Token/ikon anahtarları
    bu yüzden HER ZAMAN `{DynamicResource}` ile çözülür (`{StaticResource}` yükleme anında patlardı).
    `{StaticResource}` yalnız `BasedOn`'da ve YALNIZ BU DOSYADA daha ÖNCE tanımlı anahtarlar için kullanılır —
    WPF `BasedOn`'da DynamicResource'u desteklemez, dosya içi geriye referans ise tek başına da çözülür.
  -->

  <!-- ==================================== FOCUS HALKASI ==================================== -->
  <!--
    README:44 — "Focus: 2px rgba(237,161,15,.50) halka, offset 1px". WPF'in FocusVisualStyle'ı bir ADORNER'dır
    ve öğenin sınırlarına birebir oturur; "1px dışarıda" ancak negatif margin ile olur ve gereken değer
    -(offset + kalınlık/2)'dir (kontur çizgisi ORTALANIR). XAML aritmetik yapamaz, token'ı literal olarak
    yeniden yazmak YASAK → hesap tek yerde: controls:DsChrome.FocusRingOffset (köşe yarıçapını da o türetir).
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.FocusVisual" TargetType="Control">
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate>
          <Rectangle x:Name="Ring" SnapsToDevicePixels="True"
                     Stroke="{DynamicResource Brush.FocusRing}"
                     StrokeThickness="{DynamicResource Size.FocusRingWidth}"
                     controls:DsChrome.FocusRingOffset="{DynamicResource Size.FocusRingOffset}" />
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ======================================= BUTTON ======================================= -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:14-17 boy (sm 24 / md 28 / lg 32) · :104 gap 6 · :106 padding (sm '0 10px', diğerleri
    '0 12px') · :107 radius-sm · :110 fontSize (sm text-xs, diğerleri text-sm) · :111 fontWeight 500
    · :115 disabled opacity .45 · :114 transition background/color duration-fast ease-standard.

    Şablon TRIGGER TAŞIMAZ: durumlar Style.Triggers'ta `DsTransition.Animated*` ile ilan edilir (Step 1
    kararı). Böylece AYNI şablonu dört varyant, üç boy ve split button'ın iki yarısı paylaşır.
    Zincir: Base (kabuk) → <Varyant>.Md (renk + md ölçü) → <Varyant>.Sm/.Lg (yalnız ölçü farkı).
    Md, DS'in varsayılan boyudur (_ds_bundle.js:78 `size = 'md'`), bu yüzden zincirin çıpası odur.
  -->
  <ControlTemplate x:Key="Ds.Button.Template" TargetType="ButtonBase">
    <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
            BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
            BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
            CornerRadius="{Binding Path=(controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius), RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}"
            Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
      <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                        RecognizesAccessKey="True" SnapsToDevicePixels="True" />
    </Border>
  </ControlTemplate>

  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Base" TargetType="ButtonBase">
    <Setter Property="Template" Value="{DynamicResource Ds.Button.Template}" />
    <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{DynamicResource Ds.FocusVisual}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource Radius.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{x:Static controls:AppFonts.Ui}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="{DynamicResource FontWeight.Emphasis}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
    <Setter Property="SnapsToDevicePixels" Value="True" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <!-- _ds_bundle.js:112/:115 — disabled: opaklık .45, imleç ok. -->
      <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
        <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45" />
        <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Arrow" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <!-- _ds_bundle.js:20-31 primary: amber zemin + text-on-accent metin + saydam kenar;
       hover amber-bright (:26), press amber-dim (:29). -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Primary.Md" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Amber}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextOnAccent}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberBright}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberDim}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Primary.Sm" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Primary.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Primary.Lg" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Primary.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
  </Style>

  <!-- _ds_bundle.js:33-45 secondary: surface-raised + 1px border-strong; hover surface-overlay (:39),
       press surface (:42). -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Secondary.Md" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.BorderStrong}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Surface}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Secondary.Sm" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Secondary.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Secondary.Lg" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Secondary.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
  </Style>

  <!-- _ds_bundle.js:46-58 ghost: saydam zemin + text-secondary; hover surface-raised + text-primary (:52-53),
       press surface-overlay (:56). -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Ghost.Md" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Ghost.Sm" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Ghost.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Ghost.Lg" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Ghost.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
  </Style>

  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:60-72 danger: status-fail-soft zemin + status-fail-text metin + 1px status-fail-border.
    SAPMA (kayıtlı): hover `rgba(238,90,82,0.18)` (:66) ve press `rgba(238,90,82,0.08)` (:69) tasarımda
    TOKEN DEĞİL, ham rgba'dır (aynı ailenin -soft'u %12'dir) ve Tokens.xaml bu iki tonu TAŞIMAZ. Ham renk
    yazmak YASAK, yeni token eklemek B1 kapsamıdır → hover/press zemini -soft'ta KALIR ve durum, mevcut
    aileden bir adım parlayan KENAR/METİN ile taşınır (status-fail). Ton eklenirse burası tek satırda döner.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Danger.Md" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="12,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFailSoft}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFailText}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFailBorder}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFail}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFail}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Danger.Sm" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Danger.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
  </Style>
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Button.Danger.Lg" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Danger.Md}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="32" />
  </Style>

  <!-- ==================================== SPLIT BUTTON ==================================== -->
  <!--
    BuildApp.jsx:1591-1598. İki yarım AYNI primary gövdeyi paylaşır; birleşik görünüm yalnız İÇ köşelerin
    düzleştirilmesiyle (:1594 sağ köşeler 0 · :1596 sol köşeler 0) ve aradaki 1px amber-dim çizgiyle kurulur.
    Köşeleri SplitButton.SplitCorners gövdenin `Radius.Sm` token'ından TÜRETİR (literal köşe yazılmaz).
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.SplitButton.MenuHalf" TargetType="ToggleButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <!-- BuildApp.jsx:1596 `padding: '0 5px'` -->
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="5,0" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Amber}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextOnAccent}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberBright}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsPressed" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberDim}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <Style x:Key="Ds.SplitButton" TargetType="controls:SplitButton">
    <Setter Property="controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource Radius.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="controls:SplitButton">
          <Grid>
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
              <Button x:Name="PART_Primary" Style="{DynamicResource Ds.Button.Primary.Md}"
                      Content="{TemplateBinding PrimaryContent}"
                      Command="{TemplateBinding PrimaryCommand}" />
              <!-- BuildApp.jsx:1596 `borderLeft: 1px solid CSS `amber-dim`` — iki yarımın ayracı. -->
              <Rectangle Width="1" Fill="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberDim}" />
              <ToggleButton x:Name="PART_Menu" Style="{DynamicResource Ds.SplitButton.MenuHalf}"
                            AutomationProperties.Name="Build options"
                            IsChecked="{Binding IsMenuOpen, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}, Mode=TwoWay}">
                <!-- BuildApp.jsx:1597 `<I.chevUp/>` — 11px çizim; 24'lük viewBox Viewbox ile küçülür
                     (Path.Stretch stroke'u ölçeklemez, Viewbox ölçekler). Şablonun İÇİNDE durur:
                     bir Style Setter'ında paylaşılan UIElement iki örnek arasında çakışırdı. -->
                <Viewbox Width="11" Height="11">
                  <Canvas Width="24" Height="24">
                    <Path Data="{DynamicResource Icon.ChevUp}"
                          StrokeThickness="{DynamicResource Icon.ChevUp.StrokeThickness}"
                          Stroke="{Binding Foreground, RelativeSource={RelativeSource AncestorType=ToggleButton}}"
                          StrokeStartLineCap="Round" StrokeEndLineCap="Round" StrokeLineJoin="Round" />
                  </Canvas>
                </Viewbox>
              </ToggleButton>
            </StackPanel>
            <!-- BuildApp.jsx:1599 Popover — gövdenin ÜSTÜNDE, 8px boşlukla (BuildApp.jsx:821). -->
            <Popup x:Name="PART_MenuPopup" AllowsTransparency="True" StaysOpen="False"
                   Placement="Top" PlacementTarget="{Binding RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}"
                   VerticalOffset="-8"
                   IsOpen="{Binding IsMenuOpen, RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}, Mode=TwoWay}">
              <Border Style="{DynamicResource Ds.Popover}">
                <ContentPresenter Content="{TemplateBinding MenuContent}" />
              </Border>
            </Popup>
          </Grid>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ======================================== CHIP ======================================== -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:164-182 — height 24, padding '0 8px', gap 6, radius-xs, text-xs, fontWeight 500;
    zemin surface-raised (hover surface-overlay), kenar 1px border, metin text-secondary.
    AKTİF (:170-174): amber-soft zemin + amber-border kenar + amber-text metin.

    TİP: ToggleButton. DS'in `active` bayrağı AÇIK/KAPALI bir durumdur (filtre chip'leri, popover tetikleyen
    branch/worktree chip'leri) ve WPF'teki karşılığı IsChecked'tır.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Chip" TargetType="ToggleButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource Radius.Xs}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
      </Trigger>
      <!-- Aktif, hover'ı EZER — kaynakta da sıra `active ? … : hover ? …`tır (:170). Style.Triggers'ta
           SONRA gelen kazanır, bu yüzden bu blok hover'ın ALTINDA durmalıdır. -->
      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberSoft}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberText}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberBorder}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <!-- _ds_bundle.js:188-194 — chip'in SAYAÇ yuvası: mono, weight 400, tabular figürler, text-primary.
       Boyu chip'ten miras alınamaz (ayrı bir TextBlock'tur) → chip'in text-xs'i burada tekrar ilan edilir. -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Chip.Counter" TargetType="TextBlock">
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{x:Static controls:AppFonts.Mono}" />
    <Setter Property="FontWeight" Value="{DynamicResource FontWeight.Body}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
  </Style>

  <!-- ===================================== ICON BUTTON ===================================== -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:238-263 — kare kutu (:248 sm 22 / md 26 / lg 30; brief'in pinlediği ölçü sm 22×22),
    padding 0, radius-sm, saydam kenar; zemin saydam → hover surface-raised (:257);
    metin text-secondary → hover text-primary (:257); AKTİF: amber-soft zemin + amber-text.
  -->
  <ControlTemplate x:Key="Ds.IconButton.Template" TargetType="ButtonBase">
    <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
            BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
            BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
            CornerRadius="{Binding Path=(controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius), RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}"
            SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
      <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
    </Border>
  </ControlTemplate>

  <Style x:Key="Ds.IconButton" TargetType="Button" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Template" Value="{DynamicResource Ds.IconButton.Template}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="22" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="22" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <!-- DS `active` (aria-pressed, :247-249) AÇIK/KAPALI bir durumdur → ToggleButton. Gövde AYNI şablondur;
       ayrı bir anahtar olmasının TEK nedeni WPF'te bir Style'ın tek bir TargetType'a bağlı olmasıdır. -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.IconButton.Toggle" TargetType="ToggleButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Template" Value="{DynamicResource Ds.IconButton.Template}" />
    <Setter Property="Width" Value="22" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="22" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsMouseOver" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
      </Trigger>
      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberSoft}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberText}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <!-- ======================================= SWITCH ======================================= -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:876-903 — ray 28×16, radius-full, padding 1, 1px kenar; kapalı: surface-overlay zemin +
    border-strong kenar, başparmak 12×12 neutral-300; açık: amber zemin + amber kenar, başparmak
    text-on-accent ve 12px sağa kayar. Etiket text-sm/text-primary, ray ile arası 8px (:843).

    TİP: CheckBox — WPF'te "toggle switch" diye bir kontrol YOKTUR; iki durumlu, etiketli, klavyeyle
    erişilebilir kontrol CheckBox'tır (DS'in kendisi de `<input type="checkbox" role="switch">` kullanır, :865).

    SAPMA (kayıtlı): kapalı başparmak CSS `neutral-300` degiskenitür (colors.css:7 = #a9a9b0); Tokens.xaml nötr
    rampanın yalnız uçlarını taşır ve BU tonun oradaki adı `Brush.TextSecondary`dir (colors.css:22 AYNI hex).
    Yeni token eklemek B1 kapsamıdır → aynı değeri taşıyan mevcut anahtar kullanıldı.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Switch" TargetType="CheckBox">
    <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{DynamicResource Ds.FocusVisual}" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{x:Static controls:AppFonts.Ui}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
    <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Hand" />
    <Setter Property="SnapsToDevicePixels" Value="True" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="CheckBox">
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
            <Border x:Name="Track" Width="28" Height="16" Padding="1" BorderThickness="1"
                    CornerRadius="{DynamicResource Radius.Full}" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                    controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}"
                    controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.BorderStrong}">
              <Ellipse x:Name="Thumb" Width="12" Height="12" HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                       controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}"
                       controls:DsTransition.AnimatedTranslateX="0" />
            </Border>
            <ContentPresenter Margin="8,0,0,0" VerticalAlignment="Center" RecognizesAccessKey="True" />
          </StackPanel>
          <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
            <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
              <Setter TargetName="Track" Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Amber}" />
              <Setter TargetName="Track" Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Amber}" />
              <Setter TargetName="Thumb" Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextOnAccent}" />
              <!-- _ds_bundle.js:901 `translateX(12px)` — 28 ray - 2 padding - 12 başparmak = 12. -->
              <Setter TargetName="Thumb" Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedTranslateX" Value="12" />
            </Trigger>
            <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
              <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45" />
              <Setter Property="Cursor" Value="Arrow" />
            </Trigger>
          </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ======================================= SEGMENT ======================================= -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:305-356 — dış ray: yükseklik h+2, surface-sunken zemin + 1px border, radius-sm,
    padding 1, gap 1 (:311-317). Seçenek (:332-352): padding '0 10px', radius-xs, text-xs/500;
    seçili surface-overlay + text-primary, seçili değil saydam + text-dim.

    Varsayılan boy DS `size="sm"`dir (h=22 → dış 24): uygulamada Segment TEK yerde ve sm olarak kullanılır
    (BuildApp.jsx:1585 `<DS.Segment size="sm" …>`), brief'in pinlediği ölçü de 24'tür.

    TİP: ItemsControl + RadioButton — kaynak `role="radiogroup"` / `role="radio"` kullanır (:302, :332).
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Segment" TargetType="ItemsControl">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="24" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="1" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
    <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Left" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceSunken}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Border}" />
    <Setter Property="ItemsPanel">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ItemsPanelTemplate>
          <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" />
        </ItemsPanelTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="ItemsControl">
          <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}" BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                  BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}" Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                  CornerRadius="{DynamicResource Radius.Sm}" SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
            <ItemsPresenter />
          </Border>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <Style x:Key="Ds.Segment.Item" TargetType="RadioButton" BasedOn="{StaticResource Ds.Button.Base}">
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="10,0" />
    <!-- :316 `gap: 1` — StackPanel'de aralık yoktur, seçenekler arası boşluk margin ile verilir. -->
    <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0,0,1,0" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Xs}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsChrome.CornerRadius" Value="{DynamicResource Radius.Xs}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="Transparent" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextDim}" />
    <Style.Triggers>
      <Trigger Property="IsChecked" Value="True">
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
        <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedForeground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
      </Trigger>
    </Style.Triggers>
  </Style>

  <!-- ======================================== INPUT ======================================== -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:714-727 (inputBase) — height 28, padding '0 8px', surface-sunken zemin,
    1px border-strong (invalid: status-fail-border, :717), radius-sm, text-primary, text-sm,
    transition border-color duration-fast ease-standard (:726).
    :749 prefix varken paddingLeft 26 · :756-772 büyüteç left 8, dikey ortalı, text-dim, tıklamayı yutmaz
    :750 focus'ta 2px focus-ring halkası · :751 focus + !invalid → kenar amber-border.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Input" TargetType="TextBox">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="28" />
    <!-- :749 — VARSAYILAN prefix'LİDİR (26); prefix yoksa aşağıdaki şablon trigger'ı 8'e döner. WPF bir
         trigger'ı "null DEĞİL" diye kuramaz, bu yüzden mantık bu yönde ifade edilir. -->
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="26,0,8,0" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="1" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{x:Static controls:AppFonts.Ui}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.Sm}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
    <Setter Property="CaretBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextPrimary}" />
    <!-- Metin seçim vurgusu tasarımda TANIMSIZDIR (web `<input>`'u tarayıcının seçimini kullanır); WPF bir
         fırça İSTER. Marka ailesinden yarı saydam olan tek ton seçildi — yeni bir renk uydurulmadı. -->
    <Setter Property="SelectionBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberBorder}" />
    <Setter Property="VerticalContentAlignment" Value="Center" />
    <!-- Odak halkası kenarın KENDİSİNDE gösterilir (:750 boxShadow) — ayrıca adorner çizilmez. -->
    <Setter Property="FocusVisualStyle" Value="{x:Null}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBackground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceSunken}" />
    <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.BorderStrong}" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="TextBox">
          <Grid>
            <!-- :750 `0 0 0 <focus-ring-width> <focus-ring>` — kenarın hemen DIŞINDA, boşluksuz
                 (offset 0). Genel focus halkasından FARKI budur; kaynakta da boxShadow spread'i 0'dır. -->
            <Rectangle x:Name="FocusRing" Visibility="Collapsed" SnapsToDevicePixels="True"
                       Stroke="{DynamicResource Brush.FocusRing}"
                       StrokeThickness="{DynamicResource Size.FocusRingWidth}"
                       controls:DsChrome.FocusRingOffset="0" />
            <Border x:Name="Chrome" Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                    BorderBrush="{TemplateBinding BorderBrush}"
                    BorderThickness="{TemplateBinding BorderThickness}"
                    CornerRadius="{DynamicResource Radius.Sm}" SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
              <Grid>
                <ContentPresenter x:Name="Prefix" Margin="8,0,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left"
                                  VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False"
                                  TextElement.Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextDim}"
                                  Content="{Binding Path=(controls:DsChrome.Prefix), RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}" />
                <TextBlock x:Name="Watermark" Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                           VerticalAlignment="Center" IsHitTestVisible="False" Visibility="Collapsed"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource Brush.TextFaint}"
                           Text="{Binding Path=(controls:DsChrome.Watermark), RelativeSource={RelativeSource TemplatedParent}}" />
                <ScrollViewer x:Name="PART_ContentHost" Margin="{TemplateBinding Padding}"
                              VerticalAlignment="Center" Focusable="False"
                              HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Hidden" />
              </Grid>
            </Border>
          </Grid>
          <ControlTemplate.Triggers>
            <Trigger Property="Text" Value="">
              <Setter TargetName="Watermark" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
            </Trigger>
            <Trigger Property="controls:DsChrome.Prefix" Value="{x:Null}">
              <Setter TargetName="Prefix" Property="Visibility" Value="Collapsed" />
              <Setter Property="Padding" Value="8,0" />
            </Trigger>
            <Trigger Property="IsKeyboardFocusWithin" Value="True">
              <Setter TargetName="FocusRing" Property="Visibility" Value="Visible" />
              <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.AmberBorder}" />
            </Trigger>
            <!-- :751 `focus && !invalid` — invalid, focus'un amber kenarını EZER (bu blok SONRA gelmeli). -->
            <Trigger Property="controls:DsChrome.IsInvalid" Value="True">
              <Setter Property="controls:DsTransition.AnimatedBorderBrush" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.StatusFailBorder}" />
            </Trigger>
            <Trigger Property="IsEnabled" Value="False">
              <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.45" />
            </Trigger>
          </ControlTemplate.Triggers>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ========================================= KBD ========================================= -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:271-296 — minWidth 16, height 18, padding '0 5px', surface-raised zemin,
    1px border-strong ama ALT KENAR 2px (:285, tuş derinliği), radius-xs, mono, text-2xs, text-secondary.
    TİP: ContentControl — kutu + kenar + dolgu gerektiği için düz bir TextBlock yetmez.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Kbd" TargetType="ContentControl">
    <Setter Property="MinWidth" Value="16" />
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="18" />
    <Setter Property="Padding" Value="5,0" />
    <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="{x:Static controls:AppFonts.Mono}" />
    <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="{DynamicResource FontSize.2xs}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.TextSecondary}" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="ContentControl">
          <Border Background="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceRaised}"
                  BorderBrush="{DynamicResource Brush.BorderStrong}"
                  BorderThickness="1,1,1,2"
                  CornerRadius="{DynamicResource Radius.Xs}"
                  Padding="{TemplateBinding Padding}" SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
            <ContentPresenter HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
          </Border>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ===================================== PROGRESS BAR ===================================== -->
  <!--
    _ds_bundle.js:515-541 — yükseklik varsayılan 4 (:510), zemin surface-overlay, radius-xs, taşma gizli;
    dolgu `building` durumunda amber (:498).

    KAPSAM NOTU: `indeterminate` (:527-535) BURADA YOK. WPF'in ProgressBar'ı belirsiz durumu ŞABLON İÇİ bir
    Storyboard ile sürer — Step 1'in ölçtüğü tam da budur: şablon trigger'ındaki bir Storyboard canlı süre
    token'ı TAŞIYAMAZ. Belirsiz animasyon bu yüzden kod-tarafı yazılmalıdır ve onu KULLANAN task'a
    (ribbon'daki global progress) aittir; burada uydurma bir çözüm bırakmak YAGNI olurdu.
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.ProgressBar" TargetType="ProgressBar">
    <Setter Property="Height" Value="4" />
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
    <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.Amber}" />
    <Setter Property="BorderThickness" Value="0" />
    <Setter Property="Template">
      <Setter.Value>
        <ControlTemplate TargetType="ProgressBar">
          <Border Background="{TemplateBinding Background}"
                  CornerRadius="{DynamicResource Radius.Xs}" ClipToBounds="True" SnapsToDevicePixels="True">
            <Grid>
              <Rectangle x:Name="PART_Track" />
              <Rectangle x:Name="PART_Indicator" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Fill="{TemplateBinding Foreground}" />
            </Grid>
          </Border>
        </ControlTemplate>
      </Setter.Value>
    </Setter>
  </Style>

  <!-- ================================== POPOVER / DIALOG ================================== -->
  <!--
    Popover: BuildApp.jsx:820-823 — surface-overlay zemin, 1px border-strong, radius-lg, overlay gölgesi,
    padding 8. TİP: Border — bir Popup'ın/katmanın İÇİNE konan KABUKtur (Popup'ın kendisi çağıranındır).
  -->
  <Style x:Key="Ds.Popover" TargetType="Border">
    <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource Brush.SurfaceOverlay}" />
